                <text type="warning_situation">
				<p>MINOR FLOODING POSSIBLE AT CLARENDON WEIR FROM EARLY TUESDAY MORNING</p>
<p>MINOR FLOODING EASED AT WOODSIDE AND OAKBANK</p>

				<p/>
				<p>Moderate to locally heavy rainfall has been observed across the Onkaparinga catchment since Monday afternoon. This has caused river and creek level rises, and minor flooding is possible along the Onkaparinga River at Clarendon Weir from early Tuesday morning. </p>

				<p/>

                </text>
